---
/**
 * GitHub-faithful product shots of what each ready-made workflow produces.
 * Shared by the Workflows* variants. `size="lg"` shows extra detail for the
 * larger stages; `kind="repo-assist-week"` is the Repo Assist activity summary.
 */
import octicons from '@primer/octicons';

interface Props {
  kind: 'repo-assist' | 'repo-assist-week' | 'ci-doctor' | 'repo-status' | 'test-improver';
  size?: 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg';
}
const { kind, size = 'md' } = Astro.props;
const lg = size === 'lg';
const icon = (n: keyof typeof octicons, s = 16) => octicons[n].toSVG({ width: s, height: s });
---

<div class="wf-stage" data-size={size} aria-hidden="true">
  <div class={`gh gh-${kind}`}>
    {kind === 'repo-assist' && (<>
      <div class="gh-head">
        <div class="gh-title">Parser drops trailing comments <span class="gh-num">#311</span></div>
        <span class="gh-row"><span class="gh-state gh-state-done"><span set:html={icon('issue-closed', 14)} />Closed</span><span class="gh-lbl gh-lbl-red">bug</span><span class="gh-lbl gh-lbl-blue">parser</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="gh-tl">
        <div class="gh-cm">
          <span class="gh-av" set:html={icon('mark-github', 16)} />
          <div class="gh-box">
            <div class="gh-box-head"><b>github-actions</b><span class="gh-hide-sm"> commented</span></div>
            <div class="gh-box-body"><p>Reproduced on <code>main</code>. Fixed in #318.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gh-ev">
          <span class="gh-badge gh-badge-done" set:html={icon('issue-closed', 16)} />
          <span class="gh-ev-t"><b>github-actions</b> closed this as completed in <b>#318</b></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </>)}

    {kind === 'repo-assist-week' && (<>
      <div class="gh-head">
        <div class="gh-title">[Repo Assist] Monthly activity, October <span class="gh-num">#300</span></div>
        <span class="gh-state"><span set:html={icon('issue-opened', 14)} />Open</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gh-cm">
        <span class="gh-av" set:html={icon('mark-github', 16)} />
        <div class="gh-box">
          <div class="gh-box-head"><b>github-actions</b><span class="gh-hide-sm"> commented · this week</span></div>
          <ul class="gh-log" role="list">
            <li><span class="gh-muted" set:html={icon('tag', 16)} /><span>Labelled <b>14</b> new issues</span></li>
            <li><span class="gh-ok" set:html={icon('git-pull-request', 16)} /><span>Opened <b>#318</b> Fix trailing comment handling</span></li>
            <li><span class="gh-done" set:html={icon('git-merge', 16)} /><span><b>#309</b> Speed up config loading was merged</span></li>
            <li><span class="gh-done" set:html={icon('issue-closed', 16)} /><span>Closed <b>#297</b> as a duplicate of #284</span></li>
            <li><span class="gh-ok" set:html={icon('git-pull-request', 16)} /><span>Opened <b>#322</b> Add tests for the config loader</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </>)}

    {kind === 'ci-doctor' && (<>
      <div class="gh-box gh-merge">
        <div class="gh-merge-head">
          <span class="gh-merge-ico" set:html={icon('x', 16)} />
          <span><b>Some checks were not successful</b><br /><span class="gh-muted">1 failing and 1 successful check</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="gh-run"><span class="gh-bad" set:html={icon('x-circle-fill', 16)} /><b>CI / test</b><span class="gh-muted">Failing after 2m</span></div>
        <div class="gh-run"><span class="gh-ok" set:html={icon('check-circle-fill', 16)} /><b>CI / lint</b><span class="gh-muted">Successful in 12s</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="gh-tl">
        <div class="gh-ev">
          <span class="gh-badge gh-badge-ok" set:html={icon('issue-opened', 16)} />
          <span class="gh-ev-t"><b>github-actions</b> opened <b>test job times out on db setup</b> <span class="gh-num">#519</span></span>
        </div>
        {lg && (
          <div class="gh-cm">
            <span class="gh-av" set:html={icon('mark-github', 16)} />
            <div class="gh-box">
              <div class="gh-box-head"><b>github-actions</b><span class="gh-hide-sm"> commented</span></div>
              <div class="gh-box-body"><p><b>Likely cause:</b> <code>DB_HOST</code> is unset since the runner image update in #512. <b>Next step:</b> set the service hostname in <code>ci.yml</code>.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        )}
      </div>
    </>)}

    {kind === 'repo-status' && (<>
      <div class="gh-head">
        <div class="gh-title">Daily status, 2 October <span class="gh-num">#507</span></div>
        <span class="gh-state"><span set:html={icon('issue-opened', 14)} />Open</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gh-cm">
        <span class="gh-av" set:html={icon('mark-github', 16)} />
        <div class="gh-box">
          <div class="gh-box-head"><b>github-actions</b><span class="gh-hide-sm"> opened this issue</span></div>
          <div class="gh-box-body">
            <p>A busy day: two long-running PRs landed.</p>
            <div class="gh-stats">
              <span><b>6</b><span class="gh-muted">PRs merged</span></span>
              <span><b>4</b><span class="gh-muted">issues opened</span></span>
              <span><b>9</b><span class="gh-muted">issues closed</span></span>
            </div>
            {lg && (
              <ul class="gh-bullets" role="list">
                <li><b>#309</b> made config loading 3X faster</li>
                <li>CI is green on <code>main</code> after #521</li>
                <li><b>#301</b> needs a maintainer decision</li>
              </ul>
            )}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </>)}

    {kind === 'test-improver' && (<>
      <div class="gh-head">
        <div class="gh-title">Add tests for the config loader <span class="gh-num">#322</span></div>
        <span class="gh-state"><span set:html={icon('git-pull-request', 14)} />Open</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gh-box gh-files">
        <div class="gh-frow"><span class="gh-mono">test/config.test.ts</span><span class="gh-add-n">+64</span><span class="gh-del-n">−0</span><span class="gh-stat"><i class="a"></i><i class="a"></i><i class="a"></i><i class="a"></i><i class="a"></i></span></div>
        <div class="gh-frow"><span class="gh-mono">test/fixtures/app.yml</span><span class="gh-add-n">+12</span><span class="gh-del-n">−0</span><span class="gh-stat"><i class="a"></i><i class="a"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="gh-cov">
        <span class="gh-muted">Coverage for <span class="gh-mono">src/config.ts</span></span>
        <span class="gh-cov-n"><span class="gh-muted">41%</span><span class="gh-muted" set:html={icon('arrow-right', 14)} /><b class="gh-ok">88%</b></span>
      </div>
      {lg && (
        <div class="gh-box">
          <div class="gh-run"><span class="gh-ok" set:html={icon('check-circle-fill', 16)} /><b>All checks have passed</b><span class="gh-muted">212 tests</span></div>
        </div>
      )}
    </>)}
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .wf-stage {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    height: 17rem;
    background: var(--aw-color-bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--aw-color-divider);
    border-radius: 16px;
  }
  .wf-stage[data-size='lg'] {
    height: 25rem;
  }
  /* Small: a scaled-down shot with more air around it. */
  .wf-stage[data-size='sm'] {
    height: 15rem;
    border-color: transparent;
  }
  .wf-stage[data-size='sm'] .gh {
    top: 2.5rem;
    left: 2.5rem;
    transform: scale(0.88);
    transform-origin: top left;
  }
  @media (max-width: 47.99rem) {
    .wf-stage { height: 16rem; }
    .wf-stage[data-size='sm'] { height: 15rem; }
    .wf-stage[data-size='sm'] .gh { top: 1.75rem; left: 1.75rem; }
    .wf-stage[data-size='lg'] { height: 20rem; }
  }

  /* GitHub UI mocks: Primer-style neutrals and functional colours from site tokens. Dark first. */
  .gh {
    --gh-canvas: var(--aw-gray-13);
    --gh-subtle: var(--aw-gray-12);
    --gh-border: var(--aw-gray-9);
    --gh-rail: var(--aw-gray-10);
    --gh-fg: var(--aw-gray-1);
    --gh-muted: var(--aw-gray-5);
    --gh-neutral: var(--aw-gray-8);
    --gh-success: color-mix(in srgb, var(--aw-green-6) 85%, var(--gh-fg));
    --gh-success-em: color-mix(in srgb, var(--aw-green-6) 85%, var(--aw-gray-13));
    --gh-done: var(--aw-purple-4);
    --gh-done-em: var(--aw-purple-7);
    --gh-danger: var(--aw-red-5);
    --gh-r: 8px;

    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    left: 2rem;
    width: calc(100% + 0.5rem);
    min-height: calc(100% + 1rem);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 1.25rem 4rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--gh-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--gh-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: var(--aw-shadow-raised);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--aw-step--1);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--gh-fg);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .gh {
    --gh-canvas: var(--aw-gray-0);
    --gh-subtle: var(--aw-gray-0);
    --gh-border: var(--aw-gray-3);
    --gh-rail: var(--aw-gray-2);
    --gh-fg: var(--aw-gray-12);
    --gh-muted: var(--aw-gray-7);
    --gh-neutral: var(--aw-gray-3);
    --gh-success: color-mix(in srgb, var(--aw-green-6) 80%, var(--aw-gray-13));
    --gh-done: var(--aw-purple-7);
    --gh-done-em: var(--aw-purple-7);
    --gh-danger: color-mix(in srgb, var(--aw-red-5) 82%, var(--aw-gray-13));
  }
  .gh :global(svg) {
    display: block;
    fill: currentColor;
  }
  .gh b {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gh-fg);
  }
  .gh p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--aw-step--1);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--gh-fg);
  }
  .gh ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .gh li {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .gh code,
  .gh-mono {
    font-family: var(--aw-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--aw-step--1);
  }
  .gh code {
    padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gh-muted) 18%, transparent);
    color: var(--gh-fg);
  }
  .gh-muted { color: var(--gh-muted); }
  .gh-ok { color: var(--gh-success); }
  .gh-bad { color: var(--gh-danger); }
  .gh-done { color: var(--gh-done); }
  b.gh-ok { color: var(--gh-success); }

  /* Title then state/labels on one line; labels wrap below when space runs out. */
  .gh-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
  }
  .gh-title {
    font-size: var(--aw-step-0);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--gh-fg);
  }
  .gh-num {
    color: var(--gh-muted);
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .gh-state {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    height: 1.625rem;
    padding: 0 0.625rem 0 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 2em;
    background: var(--gh-success-em);
    color: var(--aw-gray-0);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .gh-row {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .gh-state-done {
    background: var(--gh-done-em);
  }

  .gh-av {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gh-canvas);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gh-border);
    color: var(--gh-fg);
  }

  /* Timeline: a 2px rail with circular event badges on it */
  .gh-tl {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .gh-tl::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    bottom: -3rem;
    left: calc(1rem - 1px);
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--gh-rail);
  }
  .gh-ci-doctor .gh-tl::before { top: -1.25rem; }
  .gh-ev {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    color: var(--gh-muted);
  }
  .gh-ev-t { line-height: 1.75; }
  .gh-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    margin-right: 0.375rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gh-subtle);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--gh-canvas);
    color: var(--gh-muted);
  }
  .gh-badge-ok { color: var(--gh-success); }
  .gh-badge-done {
    background: var(--gh-done-em);
    color: var(--aw-gray-0);
  }
  .gh-lbl {
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding: 0.0625rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--lbl) 30%, transparent);
    border-radius: 2em;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--lbl) 18%, transparent);
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--lbl) 55%, var(--gh-fg));
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .gh-lbl-red { --lbl: var(--aw-red-5); }
  .gh-lbl-blue { --lbl: var(--aw-blue-6); }
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .gh-lbl {
    background: var(--lbl);
    border-color: transparent;
    color: var(--aw-gray-0);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .gh-lbl-red {
    --lbl: color-mix(in srgb, var(--aw-red-5) 88%, var(--aw-gray-13));
  }

  /* Boxes: comments, merge box, file list */
  .gh-box {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    background: var(--gh-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--gh-border);
    border-radius: var(--gh-r);
  }
  .gh-cm {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .gh-cm .gh-box { flex: 1 1 auto; }
  .gh-box-head {
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
    background: var(--gh-subtle);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gh-border);
    border-radius: var(--gh-r) var(--gh-r) 0 0;
    color: var(--gh-muted);
  }
  .gh-box-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem 0.875rem 0.875rem;
    white-space: normal;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  /* Repo Assist activity log */
  .gh-log li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
  }
  .gh-log li + li { border-top: 1px solid var(--gh-border); }
  .gh-log li > span:first-child { flex: none; }

  /* Repo Status figures */
  .gh-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .gh-stats > span {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .gh-stats b {
    font-size: var(--aw-step-1);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  /* Scoped under .gh so it beats the .gh ul reset. */
  .gh .gh-bullets {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gh-border);
  }
  .gh-bullets li::before {
    content: "•";
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--gh-muted);
  }

  /* Checks merge box */
  .gh-merge-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.875rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gh-border);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .gh-merge-ico {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--gh-r);
    background: var(--gh-danger);
    color: var(--aw-gray-0);
  }
  .gh-run {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
  }
  .gh-run + .gh-run { border-top: 1px solid var(--gh-border); }

  /* PR file list with diffstats */
  .gh-frow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.875rem;
  }
  .gh-frow + .gh-frow { border-top: 1px solid var(--gh-border); }
  .gh-frow .gh-mono { margin-right: auto; padding-right: 1rem; }
  .gh-add-n { color: var(--gh-success); font-weight: 600; }
  .gh-del-n { color: var(--gh-danger); font-weight: 600; }
  .gh-stat { display: inline-flex; gap: 1px; margin-left: 0.25rem; }
  .gh-stat i {
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--gh-neutral);
  }
  .gh-stat i.a { background: var(--gh-success-em); }
  .gh-cov {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.875rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--gh-border);
    border-radius: var(--gh-r);
  }
  .gh-cov-n {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  @media (max-width: 47.99rem) {
    .gh-hide-sm { display: none; }
    .gh {
      top: 1.25rem;
      left: 1.25rem;
      padding: 1rem 2.75rem 1rem 1rem;
      gap: 1rem;
      white-space: normal;
    }
    .gh-stat { display: none; }
    .gh-stats { gap: 1rem; }
    .gh-cov { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.25rem 1rem; }
  }
</style>
